			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FF6B6B to=#FFC2C2 f=0.6>挥发性腺体</grad></shadow>"
			x: 3.5d
			y: 9.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2352027864446855"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>有暗流体从中渗出。唯一来源是凋零骷髅和凋零本身。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>大师级屠夫会付你 </grad><grad from=#FF6B6B to=#FFC2C2 f=0.8>20个绿宝石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>来换取一个。它也是凋零粘液最丰富的来源，本整合包会将三个炼成一把世界末日凋零脊骨。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "1C9D2B88E2C1163D"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "08304E3A57093634"
