		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2352027864446855"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>买卖器官</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>屠夫和牧师都处理生物魔法部件，两种方向都值得了解。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>新手屠夫</grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>出售</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>锋利獠牙换12个绿宝石，锋利爪子换10个。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>学徒屠夫用每个绿宝石购买4个肌腱或2个胆囊。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>熟手屠夫用每个绿宝石购买4个骨髓。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>专家屠夫以每个2个绿宝石的价格出售肉块和骨片。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>大师级屠夫支付 </grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>20 枚绿宝石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 换取 Withered Bone Marrow。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>牧师用四枚绿宝石购买有机瓶，用两枚绿宝石购买胆汁，这是处理炼金术溢出物的最佳方式。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>流浪商人偶尔会携带异域尘埃、肉刺、失眠药和异域肉混合物。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "minecraft:emerald"
			id: "37F5F3969CA6AF37"
			min_width: 340
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "17E4981CE6C92118"
