			id: "5652D76DE298C469"
			min_width: 380
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "0FA39323B87EC863"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#C8AE86>完整的购物清单</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2E41F44BE5950A94"
				title: "已妥善收好，存放在背包中，随时可以取用。"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6>基础组件</grad></shadow>"
			x: 1.5d
			y: 15.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2ECE65F4EECE9300"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFCFA8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>Bio-Forge</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>爪子、生肉、史莱姆球和活肉。从这里开始，你几乎不会再碰工作台了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>生物锻造炉会直接从你的物品栏中取出</grad><grad from=#FF8A4C to=#FFCFA8 f=0.8>零散组件，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>并将其组装成模组包含的一切。机器、齿轮、方块、工具。顶部的选项卡可按类别进行排序。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 此整合包中已关闭配方解锁机制，因此放置方块后所有 Bio-Forge 配方即可直接使用。无需解锁任何内容。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它和这里的其他机器一样靠养分运行，这也是下一个要解决的问题。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "6822C517E79BE9B6"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "2A13C47F6882B0C9"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 20
