		{
			dependencies: ["6E8992D2CDC1C656"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>生物魔法附魔</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>Despoil</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 使任何允许使用的武器在击杀时掉落器官。无法与 Silk Touch 共存。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>麻醉之触</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 注射生物时移除伤害和仇恨。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>外科手术般的精准度</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 提升精华品质，是通往3阶的唯一途径。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>寄生代谢</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 用你的食物条喂养活物物品。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>自动喂食</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 用快捷栏中的营养物质喂养活体物品。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>注射器和提取器也具备</grad><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>穿刺效果，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>能提高针头穿透护甲的几率。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] Universal Enchants 扩展了本整合包中所有这些内容。Parasitic Metabolism 尤其适用于整个 Confluence 配饰列表。"
			]
