				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和Maw Hopper的账单一样。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>把它装在容器上，每24个游戏刻会吸起最多</grad><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.8>3个物品</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并掉落。最好搭配漏斗，除非你喜欢自己打扫。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "56CCB63ADC3437CF"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "073D8F4A1D362044"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#9B7BD4>它会舔箱子</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0E116F02D98E7EC7"
				item: "biomancy:tongue"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.6>舌头</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 31.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3F23E5D6EF4AD817"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>可渗透膜</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>生物锻造炉中，弹性纤维加一个修饰器。每种变体都允许一类物品直接穿过，而其他物品则会弹开。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.8>不透水的</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>完全不让任何东西通过。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.8>幼体</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和</grad><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.8>成体</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>按年龄过滤。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.8>原始生物</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 允许活体生物通过， </grad><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.8>不死生物</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 允许不死生物通过。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>五种方块都有板条形式，你可以用它们建造真正的窗户。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "65D518734C26C65A"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "73F722F3F8B0CD7F"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#9B7BD4>按物种过滤的玻璃</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0822189BCCD9FA22"
				item: "biomancy:primal_permeable_membrane"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.6>膜结构</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 30.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["65D518734C26C65A"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两根弹性纤维、四份胆汁、两份宝石碎片和活肉。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>空白过滤器不会过滤任何东西。在合成台上将其与</grad><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.8>精华</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>结合，可将其锁定为特定生物类型，或与</grad><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.8>三级精华</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>结合，可将其锁定为单个个体。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>有反向版本，你可以建造一面墙，只挡住一个苦力怕，其他都能通过。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "1ACD59746414F0AB"
			rewards: [{
				id: "21B7D8ECD2CE92A8"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#9B7BD4>筛选特定生物</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "62879345FA35EF1E"
				item: "biomancy:biometric_membrane"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.6>生物膜</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 30.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3F23E5D6EF4AD817"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>锋利的獠牙、两根坚韧的纤维和一块肉块。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"多个尖刺可以挤进一个方块空间，每个尖刺都让陷阱更具致命性。东西会掉在上面，东西会被刺穿，死亡提示也非常棒。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>如果你懒得动手，流浪商人会花2个绿宝石出售它们。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "38870BBF072456BE"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "18C30E8306A85FB5"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#9B7BD4>堆叠它们以获得效果</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5D49044993F15B9C"
				item: "biomancy:flesh_spike"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.6>肉刺</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 33.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3F23E5D6EF4AD817"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>八根弹性纤维。它能展示和整理你的血清，而不是让它们在一个双箱子里腐烂。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>潜行点击可一次性插入或拉出整个架子。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "3EE4000EB2F50B1F"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "1C70D5401F875662"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 5
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#9B7BD4>八根纤维，九瓶血清</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "0192F8FDC9572310"
				item: "biomancy:vial_holder"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.6>试剂瓶架</grad></shadow>"
			x: 3.0d
			y: 31.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3F23E5D6EF4AD817"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>十个荧光凝胶、两块肉和四根弹性纤维可以合成蓝色的。加入黄色染料可合成黄色的。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Goo 还有两个小把戏。它能将物品展示框变成 </grad><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.8>发光物品展示框</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，而十个 goo 加上两种黄色染料和生物物质能产生一个 </grad><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.8>Shroomlight</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "218C9FCC061BB945"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "7459BE6418FE0EC7"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 5
			}]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#9B7BD4>非尖叫品红的灯光</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "51B0F0B601CBB791"
				item: "biomancy:bio_lantern_blue"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.6>生物灯笼</grad></shadow>"
			x: 3.0d
			y: 33.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3F23E5D6EF4AD817"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>用肉建造</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"Flesh、Packed、Fibrous、Malignant 和三种 Primal 变体各有半砖、楼梯和墙壁。Ornamental 增加半砖，Chiseled 和 Tubular 为单个方块。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>此外还有肉门、宽肉门、虹膜门、梯子、栅栏、门、柱子和肌腱链。Dramatic Doors 模组为这个整合包添加了高版本的肉门。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>所有东西都有自己独特的湿漉漉的踩踏声。无论你住在哪里，别人都会听到你走路的声音。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "15F34D9205C8C212"
			min_width: 350
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "18A7B812C0E4655E"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#9B7BD4>踩上去会发出挤压声</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "296A59433A25982E"
				item: "biomancy:packed_flesh"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#9B7BD4 to=#D8C6F2 f=0.6>血肉建筑学</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 32.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3F23E5D6EF4AD817"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>猫们把这种东西带回了家，而不是往常的晨礼。物体被一层有机的皮肤包裹着，内容物在打开前无从知晓。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>它的提示框声称，如果你的语言是德语，它可能充满了毒素。这真是个存在于模组文件里的笑话。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "0F493121F17681CD"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{
				id: "7C6D88D8903ABCB2"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 5
			}]
			shape: "square"
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#C8AE86>你的猫干的这事</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "045D8E754FAA5A31"
				item: "biomancy:gift_sac"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6>礼物袋</grad></shadow>"
			x: 3.0d
			y: 32.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3F23E5D6EF4AD817"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FC3272 to=#FCAEC7 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>基础模组中不包含的内容</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>本整合包将 Bio-Forge 接入三种独一无二的终局配方。其中两种是纯粹的 </grad><grad from=#FC3272 to=#FCAEC7 f=0.8>复制机</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，第三种则将其中一种升级为更强大的机器。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每一个都需要消耗 </grad><grad from=#FC3272 to=#FCAEC7 f=0.8>998 份养分</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>才能合成。这大约相当于每次合成需要一又半堆养分膏，所以回来之前先建好消化器循环系统吧。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 这三种物品都位于 Bio-Forge 的 Misc 标签页中，不在 Tools 或 Components 中。"
			]
			icon: "enigmaticlegacy:abyssal_heart"
			id: "68EB45796533D8D8"
			min_width: 360
			rewards: [{
				id: "7541F997F3BC3D46"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 25
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.55d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#FC3272 to=#FC3272>Linggango 骑上了什么</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1FA91C1D644B9FB4"
				title: "把最荒谬的部分展示给我看"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#FC3272 to=#FCAEC7 f=0.6>模组之外</grad></shadow>"
			x: 1.55d
			y: 31.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["68EB45796533D8D8"]
			description: [
				"在生物锻造炉中投入两个邪恶精华、两个世界末日之心和一个<a color=\"#FC3272\" color=\"#FCAEC7\" f=\"0.8\">深渊之心</a>，你就能得到<a color=\"#FC3272\" color=\"#FCAEC7\" f=\"0.8\">两个</a>回来。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这是一个带税的复制机。如果你正在追寻 Enigmatic Legacy 的黑暗面，那么这里的重复劳作就结束了。</grad></shadow>"
			]
