		{
			dependencies: ["68EB45796533D8D8"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>四个小连接</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Biomancy 在本整合包中出现在了它自己的章节之外。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>Goety</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>：Flesh Bits 每个可为 Soul Absorber 提供 2 个灵魂，Ectoplasm 会分解成 1 到 3 个 Bioluminescent Goo。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>Industrial Foregoing</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 粉色史莱姆会消化成 4 个营养膏，粉色史莱姆锭会分解成 2 到 4 个弹性纤维。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>Armageddon</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 三个 Withered Bone Marrow、一朵 wither rose 和 scorched bones 可以合成一个 Wither Spine。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>独特配饰</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>: 一朵诱惑玫瑰需要一个生物炼金肥料。</grad></shadow>"
			]
